        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blighted Deep </strong>is a minimalistic, linear <i>roguelite</i> in a dark, mysterious setting. Collect <i>Items</i> and <i>Shackles</i> that make you stronger and prepare yourself for the venture into the Deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing but his trusty magic wand, our hero will have to cleanse the deep of the terrible blight, which has spread and infected all kinds of creepy crawlies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >99+ unique items and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 steam achievements for perfectionists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tons of unique enemies, bosses and unlockable content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is <i>randomly generated</i>, so no run is like the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shoot and dodge</i> your way through <i>mystical creatures</i> and encounter <i>strange NPCs</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Epic bossfights</i> will test your <i>skill and build</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blighted Deep </strong>features a retro aesthetic and rhythmic soundtrack for a unique, yet classic roguelite experience.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blighted Deep </strong>is a minimalistic, linear <i>roguelite</i> in a dark, mysterious setting. Collect <i>Items</i> and <i>Shackles</i> that make you stronger and prepare yourself for the venture into the Deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing but his trusty magic wand, our hero will have to cleanse the deep of the terrible blight, which has spread and infected all kinds of creepy crawlies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >99+ unique items and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 steam achievements for perfectionists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tons of unique enemies, bosses and unlockable content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is <i>randomly generated</i>, so no run is like the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shoot and dodge</i> your way through <i>mystical creatures</i> and encounter <i>strange NPCs</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Epic bossfights</i> will test your <i>skill and build</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blighted Deep </strong>features a retro aesthetic and rhythmic soundtrack for a unique, yet classic roguelite experience.</p>",
